  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "At a nightclub, the chain Proprietor laughs that sales cure every doubt, yet Kawada still longs for true artistry—until a quiet young woman Reika picks up his dropped tape on the street and catches his eye.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "keieisha",
      "t": "調子戻ってきたんじゃねえのか？売れてるしな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "ええ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "keieisha",
      "t": "これは発明だわ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "本当にこれでいいんですかね？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "keieisha",
      "t": "売れてるからいいんだよ。乾杯！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "もうちょっとタイトルにコントラストをつけてほしいな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "これ、すいません。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "待ってください！アダルトビデオに興味ありませんか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "え？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "あなたなら絶対に有名になれる。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "黒木香を超えられるかもしれない。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "これ、村西とおる監督の作品です。もしよかったら。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
