      "t": "調子戻ってきたんじゃねえのか？売れてるしな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Looks like you guys got your groove back, right? Sales are booming.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "ええ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
