      "t": "これ、すいません。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Excuse me, you dropped this.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "待ってください！アダルトビデオに興味ありませんか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Wait, please! Might you have any interest in adult video?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
