      "t": "あなたなら絶対に有名になれる。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Someone like you could definitely become famous.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "黒木香を超えられるかもしれない。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You might even surpass Kaoru Kuroki.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
